  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/tables.html#attributes-common-to-td-and-th-elements\n\n> The colSpan IDL attribute must reflect the colspan content attribute. Its default value is 1.\n\nShould this also say that \"The value must be limited to only non-negative numbers greater than zero.\" ?\n\nThe section about the 'colspan' content attribute already states that the value should be greater than zero:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/tables.html#attr-tdth-colspan\n",
